                                                "sense_id": "6790ce76-3b90-308a-86b7-45283d35eb0b",
                                                "text": "when Roger asked for $100 to take the preliminary steps to establish his claim, Mike yelled like a Hebrew auctioneer, for he was air-tight and squeezed a dollar until the woman on it yelled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b497c24-c41f-405c-91fe-df1a6000deff",
                                                "sense_id": "6790ce76-3b90-308a-86b7-45283d35eb0b",
